620 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 344 0 R
/T (Pick a cardio machine or even two to switch between if you wish.  Interval training is where you cycle between an easy \(rest interval\) and hard effort \(work interval\). To make learning this process as easy as possible,, we will rest for 30 seconds at an intenstiy of 4 out of 10 and then work for an effort of 7 out of 10 for 30 seconds. Keeping it 30 and 30 makes things simple and easy to time. )
/E (Pick a cardio machine or even two to switch between if you wish.  Interval training is where you cycle between an easy \(rest interval\) and hard effort \(work interval\). To make learning this process as easy as possible,, we will rest for 30 seconds at an intenstiy of 4 out of 10 and then work for an effort of 7 out of 10 for 30 seconds. Keeping it 30 and 30 makes things simple and easy to time. )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
621 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 344 0 R
/T (Depending on your sport, interval times may change as some sports require longer or shorter work rest periods, but this is just a basic introduction.  Intervals will push you slightly harder than a same speed Zone 2 run that you have been using for your cardio in the beginner programs. This results in your cardio improving. You become better at short bursts of exercise and become fitter at more intense exercise, which is important for your overall health.)
/E (Depending on your sport, interval times may change as some sports require longer or shorter work rest periods, but this is just a basic introduction.  Intervals will push you slightly harder than a same speed Zone 2 run that you have been using for your cardio in the beginner programs. This results in your cardio improving. You become better at short bursts of exercise and become fitter at more intense exercise, which is important for your overall health.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
