672 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 348 0 R
/T (Sprints release a great amount of hormones which allow us to build more muscle. They hit a different energy system to long distance running and it is beneficial for our heart lungs and general health to be fit in this way too.  This month, lets incorporate 10 sprints into our cardio, whether outside or on the treadmill. )
/E (Sprints release a great amount of hormones which allow us to build more muscle. They hit a different energy system to long distance running and it is beneficial for our heart lungs and general health to be fit in this way too.  This month, lets incorporate 10 sprints into our cardio, whether outside or on the treadmill. )
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
673 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 348 0 R
/T (10 x 15seconds Maximum Speed Sprints if outside. 10 x 25seconds Maximum Speed Sprints if on Treadmill \(We give 10 seconds extra for the Treadmill to bring us up to our maximum speed as treadmills delay.\))
/E (10 x 15seconds Maximum Speed Sprints if outside. 10 x 25seconds Maximum Speed Sprints if on Treadmill \(We give 10 seconds extra for the Treadmill to bring us up to our maximum speed as treadmills delay.\))
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [6]
>>
