1302 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 391 0 R
/T (Zone 5 is considered the most intense form of cardio because it pushes your heart rate to its absolute max. You are working at your maximum capacity, not 70 or 80%, but your true maximum effort. It is very hard to sustain your true maximum effort for more than around 10 minutes, perhaps even less depending on who you ask. )
/E (Zone 5 is considered the most intense form of cardio because it pushes your heart rate to its absolute max. You are working at your maximum capacity, not 70 or 80%, but your true maximum effort. It is very hard to sustain your true maximum effort for more than around 10 minutes, perhaps even less depending on who you ask. )
/Pg 69 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
