<<
/Title (You will notice on your programme card that it mentions applying 3 - 5 advanced training techniques from the exercise library per workout session.)
/Dest [73 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4636 0 R
/Next 4654 0 R
>>
endobj
4654 0 obj
<<
/Title (Here are the advanced training techniques:)
/Dest [73 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4636 0 R
/Prev 4653 0 R
>>
endobj
4655 0 obj
<<
/Title (Partial reps are performed in the lower 25% of the range of motion: short, controlled pulses that maintain constant tension in the muscle. They are used at the end of a set, when full reps are no longer possible, to maximize muscle fatigue. After reaching muscle failure, perform 3 to 5 partial reps before lowering the weight. You can also perform partial reps with each rep of your set, doing 3 partial reps for every repetition. Try both methods often!)
/Dest [73 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4638 0 R
>>
endobj
