<<
/Title (Zone 5 is considered the most intense form of cardio because it pushes your heart rate to its absolute max. You are working at your maximum capacity, not 70 or 80%, but your true maximum effort. It is very hard to sustain your true maximum effort for more than around 10 minutes, perhaps even less depending on who you ask.)
/Dest [69 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4666 0 R
/Next 4684 0 R
>>
endobj
4684 0 obj
<<
