/Title (Boxing and kickboxing are sports found to burn the most calories per hour. Most gyms have a punch bag or an open space to practice technique. The good thing about boxing is it uses your intelligence to learn new combos. There is always a new combo to learn, so your cardio can be fun, intellectual and you can learn a skill instead of just repetitively running on a treadmill or doing a circuit. Boxing can be great for days where your brain needs some stimulation and normal cardio seems boring.)
